Unko formerly linked tetanes-core; that adapter has been retired and no
TetaNES code is included in the current tree.

The desktop frontend uses egui/eframe (https://github.com/emilk/egui),
Copyright (c) egui developers, dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. Its
UX structure is inspired by Dolphin, but no Dolphin code, icons or
assets are included.

Desktop input and audio use:
- SDL3 (https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL), zlib
- cpal (https://github.com/RustAudio/cpal), MIT OR Apache-2.0
- rtrb (https://github.com/mgeier/rtrb), MIT OR Apache-2.0
- hound (https://github.com/ruuda/hound), Apache-2.0
- png (https://github.com/image-rs/image-png), MIT OR Apache-2.0
- gif (https://github.com/image-rs/image-gif), MIT OR Apache-2.0
- directories (https://github.com/dirs-dev/directories-rs), MIT OR Apache-2.0

Archive reading uses:
- zip (https://github.com/zip-rs/zip2), MIT
- sevenz-rust2 (https://github.com/hasenbanck/sevenz-rust), Apache-2.0
- rars (https://github.com/bitplane/rars), Apache-2.0

The Apache-2.0 text is reproduced in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

No ROM images are included or distributed by this project.

The NES accuracy core (`nes_accuracy_core`) includes algorithms adapted
from the ares emulator (https://github.com/ares-emulator/ares), Copyright
(c) 2004-2025 ares team, Near et al, used under the ISC license. The full
ares license text is reproduced in `licenses/ares-LICENSE.txt`.

No GPL-licensed emulator source (including MesenCE, RustyNES or Dolphin) is
included in this repository.
